	(footprint "irl2fa:PhotoTransistor_Vishay_VEMT2523SLX01_SideView"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "b996f0fd-e212-43e7-baf0-0d3fd865c68f")
		(at 120.5 101.37)
		(descr "Vishay VEMT2523SLX01 side-looking NPN phototransistor detector, 2.3x2.55x2.3 mm MiniLED side-view package (LCSC C511451). Pads 0.9x1.2, 4.2 mm outer span (Vishay IPC-7351 pad proposal). Pad 1=C, pad 2=E. Optical axis is parallel to the PCB along -Y, i.e. the TOP edge of the footprint faces the board edge: lens tip at y=-1.37, lens base / body front face at y=-0.42, body back at y=+1.18, optical axis 1.15 mm above the PCB. Place the origin 1.37 mm inside the board edge for a flush lens.")
